   466→  // AC: @trait-dry-run ac-5
   467→  // AC: @trait-json-output ac-4 -- N/A: session IDs are identifiers, not @ref-index references.
   468→  // AC: @trait-json-output ac-5 -- N/A: this command does not emit timestamps in top-level totals.
   469→  // AC: @trait-json-output ac-6 -- N/A: no competing output-format flags beyond global --json.
   470→  // AC: @trait-semantic-exit-codes ac-2 -- covered by usage-error validation tests above.
   471→  // AC: @trait-semantic-exit-codes ac-4 -- covered by malformed criteria and runtime exception path.
   472→  // AC: @trait-semantic-exit-codes ac-7 -- covered by refs partial-failure test above.
   473→  // AC: @trait-semantic-exit-codes ac-8 -- N/A: exit code constants documented centrally.
   474→  // AC: @trait-error-guidance ac-4 -- N/A: command has no state machine transitions; only validation/lookup errors.
   475→  // AC: @trait-shadow-commit ac-1 -- covered via non-dry-run stale close mutation path.
